      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How are Packers And Movers In Chennai rates calculated for a typical 2‑BHK household shift?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Rates are derived from a combination of factors: total volume of goods, distance (approximately 850 km to major hubs), type of packaging required, and any special handling such as fragile or high‑value items. Our transparent cost matrix breaks down each component, ensuring no hidden fees and allowing you to compare the quote with confidence.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is the insurance offered by Packers And Movers In Chennai sufficient for valuable electronics and artwork?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. We provide 100 % declared‑value IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance that covers the full replacement cost of your items, including high‑value electronics and artwork. The policy is automatically included in the moving package, and you receive a detailed insurance certificate for your records.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documentation is required to claim reimbursement from a corporate or government entity after using Packers And Movers In Chennai?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You will need the original GST‑compliant invoice, a signed delivery receipt, the e‑Way bill generated for the transit, and the insurance claim form if any loss occurred. All documents are provided digitally within 24 hours of delivery, meeting the compliance standards of central, state and PSU reimbursements.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can Packers And Movers In Chennai handle vehicle transportation alongside household goods?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. Our fleet includes specialized multi‑car trailers equipped with hydraulic loading ramps, wheel chocks, and high‑tensile ratchet lashings. Vehicles are secured separately from household cargo, and live GPS tracking lets you monitor both shipments in real time throughout the Chennai‑to‑hub journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the 7‑layer protective packaging system protect delicate items during the Chennai to Destination Hub route?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The system starts with 80‑GSM heavy‑duty bubble wrap, followed by high‑density foam edge protectors, multi‑ply corrugated sheets, stretch film for weatherproofing, and custom wooden crates for extremely fragile pieces. Each layer absorbs shocks, mitigates vibration, and shields against humidity, ensuring items arrive intact after the 850 km transit.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What are the typical transit times for moves from Chennai to major hubs like Kolkata or Hyderabad?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Transit time varies with traffic and checkpoint clearances but generally ranges from 3 to 5 business days for the 850 km corridor via NH 16. Our route performance highlights include real‑time GPS updates and proactive checkpost advisory, allowing you to plan arrivals with minimal uncertainty.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there any additional charges for moving bulky furniture such as a king‑size bed or a wooden wardrobe?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Bulky items are accounted for in the volumetric calculation, but if they exceed standard dimensions, a minimal handling surcharge may apply. This fee covers the use of specialized equipment like hydraulic lifts and extra protective crating, and it is disclosed upfront in the cost matrix before you confirm the booking.</p>
      </div>
